{"3019020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unseen Beings", "steam_appid": 3019020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You owe a debt. They are sending you to retrieve a black briefcase in a secret auction house where they sell man-eating entities to the rich and powerful. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The auction house has had an incident and has become infested with invisible entities. You must use special goggles to see them, and avoid or fight them, while solving puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special goggles to track entity traces and see invisible messages/entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 distinct areas each with their own mechanics and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use key items to unlock paths and solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid invisible entities or fight them with your taser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra modes and ways to play after completing the game</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to Survive </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019020/extras/38444cbf5ab5d60480f40c65c33e6275.poster.avif?t=1787852563\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019020/extras/38444cbf5ab5d60480f40c65c33e6275.webm?t=1787852563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019020/extras/38444cbf5ab5d60480f40c65c33e6275.mp4?t=1787852563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >See the Unseen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster